/**
 * Policy Clause Templates — Business Continuity (p34-p36)
 * Based on ISO 27001:2022, ISO 22301, BSI IT-Grundschutz, NIST CSF 2.0, NIS2 Art.21
 *
 * Scope delegation:
 *   p34 — Strategic Business Continuity (BIA, crisis management, plans, governance)
 *   p35 — Technical Disaster Recovery (RTO/RPO, failover, replication, DR infrastructure)
 *   p36 — Data Persistence & Backup (3-2-1 rule, schedules, encryption, immutable storage)
 *
 * Cross-reference rules:
 *   - Emergency/crisis communication → p34-c06 (single source)
 *   - Ransomware recovery workflow → p35-c06; ransomware-resistant architecture → p36-c20
 *   - Cloud DR strategy → p35-c07; cloud backup strategy → p36-c09
 *   - Database recovery procedures → p35-c11; database backup procedures → p36-c15
 *   - End-user DR → p35-c14; end-user backup → p36-c17
 */
